Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 11:39:53 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1042/1265] Like, dislike and favourite in the player; All
 Workspaces
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- The player has 👍 👎 ☆ for what plays, as SUNO has: a second click takes a like back; the
  favourite is the server's own. Likes live with the Collection marks (yue2_os/collection.json),
  show on the cards and filter the Collection.
- "All takes" is "All Workspaces" (Viktor), in the header and the Collection.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
